    {
      "subId": "7514911",
      "subQuestName": "Activate the mechanism",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751491101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751491101": {
            "id": "751491101",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Ehrr...Rroo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491102"
            ]
          },
          "751491102": {
            "id": "751491102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What's wrong? You don't look like you're doing so hot...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491103"
            ]
          },
          "751491103": {
            "id": "751491103",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawrgh!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491104"
            ]
          },
          "751491104": {
            "id": "751491104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is that... the Abyss?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491105"
            ]
          },
          "751491105": {
            "id": "751491105",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Indeed... Abyssal creatures invade the Sacred City of Tollan like an irremediable pestilence.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491106"
            ]
          },
          "751491106": {
            "id": "751491106",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"At this point, it may even be impossible to contain their march completely without bringing the Sacred Mountain itself down around us...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491107"
            ]
          },
          "751491107": {
            "id": "751491107",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "When you discover one Abyssal creature...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491108"
            ]
          },
          "751491108": {
            "id": "751491108",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Then perhaps your home is already completely infested with those stygian, viscid villains...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491109"
            ]
          },
          "751491109": {
            "id": "751491109",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Roar...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491110"
            ]
          },
          "751491110": {
            "id": "751491110",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh, why do you guys have to be so creepy about it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491111"
            ]
          },
          "751491111": {
            "id": "751491111",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We'll chop their legs off — that'll put a stop to any marching they might do!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491112"
            ]
          },
          "751491112": {
            "id": "751491112",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ooh, how very wise and insightful, now all we need to do is find their legs... Ha! As if Paimon could say that with a straight face!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491113"
            ]
          },
          "751491113": {
            "id": "751491113",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrrawr?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491114"
            ]
          },
          "751491114": {
            "id": "751491114",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Haha. 'Tis a shame, little one, but I fear most Abyssal creatures may not need legs for locomotion.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491115"
            ]
          },
          "751491115": {
            "id": "751491115",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"...Only by destroying the shadowy foe that bars our path may you pass through this place and reach the Sacred Mountain's heart.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491116"
            ]
          },
          "751491116": {
            "id": "751491116",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Nothing can be done now to restore the glory this ravaged city had of old, but neither should its carcass be left to the tender mercies of these dark monsters.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491117"
            ]
          },
          "751491117": {
            "id": "751491117",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Wait, don't you have those big fireballs...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491118"
            ]
          },
          "751491118": {
            "id": "751491118",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's right. Don't you use them to fight the Abyss?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491119"
            ]
          },
          "751491119": {
            "id": "751491119",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Fireballs... You mean the Astral Assemblages? Nay, they may only trigger mutual annihilation on contact with the Abyss. Otherwise, they will instead be corrupted and enveloped by the dark...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491120"
            ]
          },
          "751491120": {
            "id": "751491120",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Alas, this city has been sealed off for too long... And the Astral Assemblages have been prevented from moving freely to maintain its stability...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491121"
            ]
          },
          "751491121": {
            "id": "751491121",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"O Chosen of Dragons...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491122"
            ]
          },
          "751491122": {
            "id": "751491122",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491123"
            ]
          },
          "751491123": {
            "id": "751491123",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"The Heart of the Sacred Mountain was re-excavated after Tollan was established... and the first Secret Source Dragon Idol stands guard over it.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491124"
            ]
          },
          "751491124": {
            "id": "751491124",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"You must obtain a permit to gain access to the Heart...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491125"
            ]
          },
          "751491125": {
            "id": "751491125",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"But the power source of the Idol has also been corrupted. We must find some way to reactivate it...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491126"
            ]
          },
          "751491126": {
            "id": "751491126",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"They...\" Warning. Functions damaged. Shutdown imminent... \"Ah, looks like this machine is...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491127"
            ]
          },
          "751491127": {
            "id": "751491127",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Amaru? Hey, Amaru! What permit? C'mon, you'd barely started talking!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491128"
            ]
          },
          "751491128": {
            "id": "751491128",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"Heh... Keep pressing on. A new Secret Source Servant shall guide you there...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491129"
            ]
          },
          "751491129": {
            "id": "751491129",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "*whirr-click*...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491130"
            ]
          },
          "751491130": {
            "id": "751491130",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "\"This is the map of the Sacred City's core. I will... await you at...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491131"
            ]
          },
          "751491131": {
            "id": "751491131",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah, and the light's gone out again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491132"
            ]
          },
          "751491132": {
            "id": "751491132",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Guess this \"Amaru\" guy isn't gonna be talking to us anymore, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491133"
            ]
          },
          "751491133": {
            "id": "751491133",
            "speakerId": 21800,
            "speakerName": "Secret Source Servant",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751491134"
            ]
          },
          "751491134": {
            "id": "751491134",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He really just does whatever he feels like, huh... Not much we can do but forge ahead and see if we can't rustle up a new Secret Source Servant..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7514912",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Paimon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751490301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751490301": {
            "id": "751490301",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "\"Have I officially given you its name, by the by? I believe I have not...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490302"
            ]
          },
          "751490302": {
            "id": "751490302",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "\"No matter. Welcome to the first Sacred Ci{RUBY#[D]Land of Primal Flame}ty, Tollan.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490303"
            ]
          },
          "751490303": {
            "id": "751490303",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa... Paimon was not expecting the volcano to look like this on the inside...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490304"
            ]
          },
          "751490304": {
            "id": "751490304",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is that really where we are? Or did we get yoinked to a different spot when we went through the volcano's mouth?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490305"
            ]
          },
          "751490305": {
            "id": "751490305",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrah... Rawr!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490306"
            ]
          },
          "751490306": {
            "id": "751490306",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "\"Oh, this is undoubtedly the Sacred Mountain's interior, but even I... know not how long it has been since I saw such a sight...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490307"
            ]
          },
          "751490307": {
            "id": "751490307",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "\"Ah... Only when the light shone upon you once more, did I see that you had mouldered so...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490308"
            ]
          },
          "751490308": {
            "id": "751490308",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ehecatl?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490309"
            ]
          },
          "751490309": {
            "id": "751490309",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490310"
            ]
          },
          "751490310": {
            "id": "751490310",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrrawr?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490311"
            ]
          },
          "751490311": {
            "id": "751490311",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "\"Ah, my apologies. Mere brief indulgence in unnecessary sentimentality...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490312"
            ]
          },
          "751490312": {
            "id": "751490312",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "Energy reserve low... Hibernation imminent. Please replace or connect... energy storage medium...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490313"
            ]
          },
          "751490313": {
            "id": "751490313",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "\"Haha. It seems like dear Ehecatl's long 'exile' has left it with little time...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490314"
            ]
          },
          "751490314": {
            "id": "751490314",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, what do you mean? Is Ehecatl... gonna die?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490315"
            ]
          },
          "751490315": {
            "id": "751490315",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "\"The one you name Ehecatl has long ceased to be amongst the living... To be brief, Tollan requires a great amount of energy to be restarted, and no waste can be permitted. You must...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490316"
            ]
          },
          "751490316": {
            "id": "751490316",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "\"Destroy the seal on one of the other two 'Astral As{RUBY#[D]Tzitzimimeh}semblages'... and the other... Only then can you truly activate the Celestial Axis in the center...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490317"
            ]
          },
          "751490317": {
            "id": "751490317",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "\"Uhhh...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490318"
            ]
          },
          "751490318": {
            "id": "751490318",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You alright over there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490319"
            ]
          },
          "751490319": {
            "id": "751490319",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "\"...I am fine. We will... meet again...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490320"
            ]
          },
          "751490320": {
            "id": "751490320",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "\"*sigh* ... Onward then, Chosen of Dragons... Alas, the pain of a body losing its vitality... I am not used to it... even after all these years...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490321"
            ]
          },
          "751490321": {
            "id": "751490321",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490322"
            ]
          },
          "751490322": {
            "id": "751490322",
            "speakerId": 21812,
            "speakerName": "Ehecatl",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490323"
            ]
          },
          "751490323": {
            "id": "751490323",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The light around Ehecatl's gone... It's not moving anymore, either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490324"
            ]
          },
          "751490324": {
            "id": "751490324",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon's still kinda confused... Was that really Ehecatl talking, or was someone else speaking through it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490327"
            ]
          },
          "751490327": {
            "id": "751490327",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "True. Still, about the Astral Assemblages he mentioned just now... Does he mean something like that big fireball from earlier? And what's this Celestial Axis thing? We don't have any idea what that is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490328"
            ]
          },
          "751490328": {
            "id": "751490328",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh well, let's take a look around and see if we can find those strange things he mentioned!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751490329"
            ]
          },
          "751490329": {
            "id": "751490329",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rawr!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
